          "templateOptions": {
            "title": "Identificação do Protocolo de Cumprimento da Solicitação do Auto de Infração/Notificação",
            "subtitle": "",
            "textHtml": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(253,253,253);color:rgb(51,51,51);\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Este campo é destinado ao registro do protocolo referente ao cumprimento das exigências constantes no Auto de Infração/Notificação.</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(253,253,253);color:rgb(51,51,51);\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Devem ser informados aqui os dados do protocolo de </span></span><strong style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253);color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">pedido de licenciamento ambiental</strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(253,253,253);color:rgb(51,51,51);\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">,&nbsp;</span></span><strong style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253);color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">pedido de aprovação de PRAD</strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(253,253,253);color:rgb(51,51,51);\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">, entre outros.</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(253,253,253);color:rgb(51,51,51);\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Cabe salientar que este protocolo é utilizado </span></span><strong style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253);color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">apenas para o envio da defesa/recurso</strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(253,253,253);color:rgb(51,51,51);\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"> e&nbsp;</span></span><strong style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253);color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">não corresponde ao protocolo de análise ou aprovação</strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(253,253,253);color:rgb(51,51,51);\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"> de nenhum outro processo.</span></span><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(253,253,253);color:rgb(51,51,51);\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">O pedido de análise/aprovação deverá ser encaminhado </span></span><strong style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(253, 253, 253);color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">separadamente</strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(253,253,253);color:rgb(51,51,51);\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">, conforme determinado no respectivo Auto de Infração.</span></span></p>",
